{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116939","id":3341888062,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HMSo-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116939","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116939.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116939","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116939/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116939/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116939/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f877b970a54692cf802da2aef81c1948fa2a6d35","number":116939,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add SPM support for Apple Embedded plugins (.gdip)","user":{"login":"gumaciel","id":20030153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDMwMTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20030153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel","html_url":"https://github.com/gumaciel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add `spm_packages` key to the `[dependencies]` section of `.gdip` files, allowing plugins to declare Swift Package Manager dependencies with exact version pinning. The export pipeline generates the corresponding PBX entries in the Xcode project.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSatisfies https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4758. Thanks to @MileyHollenberg for initial integration with Cocoapods and telling us about SPM!\r\n\r\nDocs PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11805\r\n\r\nThis PR prevents external plugins from having to rely on hacky workarounds (like post-export scripts) to add Swift Package Manager (SPM) dependencies.\r\n\r\nSPM is an excellent addition that will massively simplify the distribution and usage of iOS plugins because:\r\n\r\n- **No more post-export hacks**: Plugins no longer need complex export scripts to manipulate the generated Xcode project.\r\n- **One-Click Deploy**: SPM dependencies are natively resolved, guaranteeing that One-Click Deploy works out of the box.\r\n- **CI/CD Ready**: Natively supports automated build pipelines.\r\n- **Lighter, Cleaner Plugins**: Plugins become significantly smaller and simpler since heavy frameworks no longer need to be downloaded or embedded in the repository.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis implementation was designed with developer experience in mind. The new `.gdip` format places the SPM packages directly inside the existing `[dependencies]` section:\r\n\r\n```ini\r\n[dependencies]\r\nlinked=[]\r\nembedded=[]\r\nsystem=[\"AppTrackingTransparency.framework\"]\r\ncapabilities=[]\r\nfiles=[]\r\nlinker_flags=[\"-ObjC\"]\r\nspm_packages=[\r\n  {\r\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/googleads/swift-package-manager-google-mobile-ads.git\",\r\n    \"version\": \"12.14.0\",\r\n    \"products\": [\"GoogleMobileAds\"]\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis approach is highly beneficial because:\r\n\r\n1. **Self-Documenting**: The JSON-like `Array[Dictionary]` format exposes `url`, `version`, and `products` explicitly.\r\n1. **Extensible**: More keys (like `platforms` or `checksums`) can be easily added in the future without breaking the parser.\r\n1. **Familiarity**: It respects and closely follows how SPM natively structures its package dependencies.\r\n1. **Deterministic Builds**: The export pipeline forces the Xcode requirement kind to be `exactVersion`. This guarantees reproducible builds and prevents bugs caused by dependencies silently updating to different versions.\r\n1. **100% Backwards Compatible**: Older Godot versions parsing this `.gdip` file will simply ignore the `spm_packages` key safely.\r\n\r\nData Flow Diagram:\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n    A[\"📄 .gdip file<br/><b>[dependencies]</b><br/>spm_packages=[...]\"] -->|ConfigFile::load| B[\"load_plugin_config()<br/><i>plugin_config_apple_embedded.cpp</i>\"]\r\n    B -->|\"Vector&lt;SPMPackage&gt;\"| C[\"_export_apple_embedded_plugins()<br/><i>editor_export_platform_apple_embedded.cpp</i>\"]\r\n    C -->|Deduplicate by URL| D[\"PBX Generation\"]\r\n    D --> E[\"spm_packages<br/><i>packageReferences list</i>\"]\r\n    D --> F[\"spm_package_refs<br/><i>XCRemoteSwiftPackageReference</i>\"]\r\n    D --> G[\"spm_package_products<br/><i>XCSwiftPackageProductDependency</i>\"]\r\n    D --> H[\"modules_buildfile<br/><i>PBXBuildFile</i>\"]\r\n    D --> I[\"modules_buildphase<br/><i>Frameworks build phase</i>\"]\r\n    E --> J[\"_fix_config_file()<br/>Template Substitution\"]\r\n    F --> J\r\n    G --> J\r\n    H --> J\r\n    I --> J\r\n    J -->|\"$spm_packages<br/>$spm_package_refs<br/>$spm_package_products\"| K[\"📦 project.pbxproj<br/><i>Xcode resolves SPM at build time</i>\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBinaries: [poing-godot-admob-ios.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25670208/poing-godot-admob-ios.zip)\r\n\r\nFollow plugin tutorial if needed (just don't follow the Cocoapods step, this should be automatically now with SPM): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TB7WhP8mieo\r\n\r\nOr:\r\n- Clone repository: https://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin\r\n- Checkout to branch [205-prepare-for-spm-godot-47](https://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin/tree/205-prepare-for-spm-godot-47)\r\n- Download the [poing-godot-admob-ios.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25670208/poing-godot-admob-ios.zip)\r\n- Paste into `res://ios/plugins`\r\n- Export the project ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht